{
 "description": "Requires a ChainHelix API key as bearer token, or 2 cents per call paid over Binance b402 in USDT, USDC, USD1 or U on BNB Smart Chain, or over x402 in USDC on the Base network. Layer two bridge activity over a window, read from the Ethereum side: base and optimism deposits with the ETH they carry, and withdrawals proven and finalized (count only, the events carry no value: valueEth null); arbitrum as L1 to L2 message count only (no value, no withdrawals). window in hours, default 24, max 720; each hour is published about 90 minutes after it ends. Omit l2 for all three",
